-- =====================================================================
-- WebForge seed data (catalogue + assessments)
-- Run after schema.sql. Users are NOT seeded here because password hashes
-- must be generated by PHP's password_hash(); see backend/bin/setup.php.
--
-- Answer-key conventions (enforced by the quiz grader):
--   mcq | true_false | find_error : question_options.is_correct marks the answer
--   output                         : payload_json = {"accepted": ["..."]}
--                                    (compared trimmed, case-insensitive, whitespace-
--                                     collapsed, surrounding quotes stripped)
--   match                          : payload_json = {"left":[..], "right":[..],
--                                    "answer":[rightIndexForLeft0, ...]}
--                                    The API strips "answer" before sending.
-- =====================================================================
